    "question": "My React app calls an HTTP-triggered Azure Function with fetch. How do I make the request from a React component, and how do I enable CORS on the Function App so the browser allows it?",
    "evidence_pack": {
        "status": "OK",
        "version_covered": "Azure Functions: not version-specific",
        "answer": "To let the browser call the Function App, add your React app's origin to its allowed CORS origins with az functionapp cors add, passing the app name, the resource group and --allowed-origins.",
