                "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/azure-functions/functions-how-to-use-azure-function-app-settings#platform-features",
                "quote": "Use the [`az functionapp cors add`](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cli/azure/functionapp/cors#az-functionapp-cors-add) command to add a domain to the allowed origins list.",
                "source": "ms_learn"
            },
            {
                "id": "ms-e2",
                "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/azure-functions/functions-how-to-use-azure-function-app-settings#platform-features",
                "quote": "az functionapp cors add --name <FUNCTION_APP_NAME> \\\n--resource-group <RESOURCE_GROUP_NAME> \\\n--allowed-origins https://contoso.com",
